Cuplivo Android workspace sandbox — third-party native code
==========================================================

This directory packages prebuilt Termux binaries (fetched by
`tool/fetch_proot.sh`, gitignored) and JNI derived from Termux.

PRoot (libproot_exec.so, libproot_loader.so)
--------------------------------------------
PRoot <https://proot-me.github.io> / <https://github.com/termux/proot>
License: GNU GPL-2.0-or-later

Cuplivo executes these binaries as a separate process (not linked into the
AGPL-3 application). Corresponding source is the Termux proot tree at the
version below.

